= Trust Recommendations =

You DPS — Chakra / Focus / Dodge / Counterstance. You need: tank, healer, Haste, attack buffs.

{{html clean="false"}}
<table class="gt">
<thead><tr><th style="width:60px;">Slot</th><th style="width:200px;">Trust</th><th>Why</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td class="lv">1</td><td>🛡️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/August">August</a></strong></td><td>Tank</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">2</td><td>✨ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Yoran-Oran_(UC)">Yoran-Oran UC</a></strong></td><td>+50 Cure Potency, Stoneskin, Afflatus Solace, full status removal — strongest raw healer</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">3</td><td>✨ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Koru-Moru">Koru-Moru</a></strong></td><td>Haste on you, Phalanx II on August, Slow/Distract debuffs on mob</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">4</td><td>🎵 <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Joachim">Joachim</a></strong></td><td>March/Madrigal boost your multi-hit attacks</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">5</td><td>⚔️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Volker">Volker</a></strong></td><td>Smart AI — detects August is tanking, auto-switches to Berserk/Aggressor DPS mode</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
