= 🥊 Weapons =

**Note:** MNK can equip Clubs and Staves but Hand-to-Hand delivers the same blunt damage at A+ skill (vs B for clubs/staves), generally higher DMG/Delay, and is the only weapon affected by **Martial Arts**.

